  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "See CHANGELOG.md. Requires Windows App SDK 2.3.2+ (raised from 2.2.1). Breaking/behavioural: the synchronous ParseHtml/LoadHtml/InsertHtml no longer download remote images (use the Async variants); AllowRemoteImagesOnPaste now also governs LoadHtml*/InsertHtml; turning a list off now clears its nesting level; RTF output reshaped for HWP/Word table and alignment fidelity. The control API may still change.",
